window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A forbidden passion that burns beyond vows.</p> <p>Stephen Moody weaves a scorching erotic romance sparked by a fevered dream, earning praise as the “Dirtiest Book I’ve Ever Read” by captivated listeners. Roselyn, bound to a loveless marriage, locks eyes with Stefano, and a soul-deep spark ignites, a primal, spiritual connection that screams they’re fated. Their desire, raw and insatiable, defies every rule, pulling them into a whirlwind of stolen touches and whispered yearnings. This isn’t just lust; it’s a soulmate bond that sets their world ablaze.</p> <p>From that first smoldering glance, their chemistry is electric, a magnetic pull that transcends lifetimes. Roselyn’s heart races as Stefano’s gaze strips her bare, awakening a hunger she can’t deny. Their secret rendezvous pulse with heat; each caress, each kiss, a defiance of the chains binding them. Moody’s vivid prose paints their passion in sultry detail, making you feel the fire of their taboo love. It’s a dance of desire and destiny, where every moment together feels like a sacred rebellion against a world that demands they stay apart.</p> <p>This isn’t your typical romance. It’s a spicy, soul-stirring escape into a forbidden affair where love is fierce and unapologetic. Roselyn and Stefano’s longing to be one, to merge souls, drives them to risk everything.</p> <p>If <i>Fifty Shades of Grey</i> left you craving more heat, <i>Bared to You</i> set your pulse racing, or <i>Punk 57</i> hooked you with its forbidden edge, Stephen Moody’s <i>Hold On to the Love: Forbidden Love</i> delivers a scorching blend of eroticism and heart-wrenching romance.</p> <p>For listeners craving a blend of steamy intimacy and spiritual depth, this book delivers a heart-pounding ride. <i>Dive into Hold On to the Love: Forbidden Love</i> and surrender to a passion that burns brighter than any taboo. Download today and lose yourself in their blazing, fated love.</p>"; 
